{title: Amado Salvador}
{key: Bb}

{comment: Verso 1}
[Bb]Amado [Eb]Salvador,
[F7]Cuán dulce es [Bb]para mí
[Bb]Tu [Bb]nombre [Eb]pronunciar
[Bb]Y acercarme [F7]a [Bb]ti.

{comment: Coro 1}
[Bb]Oh, [Eb]Señor,
[F7]Mi Dios [Bb]Salvador,
[Bb]Yo tuyo [Eb]sólo [Bb]soy,
[Bb]Y tú, [F7]mi [Bb]Señor.

{comment: Verso 2}
[Bb]Reclamo [Eb]tu [Bb]amistad,
[F7]Amigo tú, [Bb]Señor,
[Bb]De aquél [Eb]que de [Bb]verdad
[Bb]Se [Bb]siente [F7]pecador.

{comment: Verso 3}
[Bb]Mi [Bb]duro [Eb]corazón
[F7]Oyó hablar [Bb]de ti,
[Bb]Y entonces [Eb]yo [Bb]clamé:
[Bb]Oh, ten [F7]piedad de [Bb]mí.

{comment: Verso 4}
[Bb]Así [Bb]yo [Eb]cantaré,
[F7]Pues sé que es [Bb]la verdad,
[Bb]El [Bb]soberano [Eb]Dios
[Bb]Me da [Bb]su [F7]amistad.
